{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZB9lSih5CM1794538033.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>11月19日便是《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》大喜日子，昨晚逾80藝員齊集6號幹線 (中九龍繞道—九龍灣段)，為台慶拍攝拍攝序幕，出席藝員有張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛、吳偉豪、朱敏瀚、陳曉華、馬貫東、劉佩玥、羅天宇、黃庭鋒等，一眾藝員有隧道口齊齊起舞，場面十分熱鬧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_01.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264YoNbErzlO1794537828.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_02.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026I6qSHzFvtw1794537835.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_03.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KEPiZg5AiV1794537843.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_04.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265cJ3w3SZTc1794537851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"IG_05.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EWhhaB9fcL1794537859.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:35:01.039301+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:50:54.358840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T03:28:24.356331+00:00","content_hash":"dca40c6f7efe1c577abcfb4d37706c872df8f3f05f949063a92b28af99fbb4e1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}